{
  "scene_id": "act2_scene1_pressure",
  "start": "n1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/club2/day1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.8,
      "next": "n2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_music",
      "track": "assets/music/editors_life.ogg",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "next": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The festival is two weeks away. What used to feel like excitement now feels like a countdown.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "No, no, no. The transition into the bridge is all wrong. We've been over this.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "anxious",
      "transition": "slide_left",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "anxious",
      "text": "S-sorry, I thought I had the timing right this time...",
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Thinking isn't enough. You need to know it. From the top, everyone.",
      "next": "n9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "transition": "slide_right",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "We've done it from the top six times already, Tiffany. Maybe the problem isn't us.",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Excuse me? The arrangement is fine. The execution is what's lacking.",
      "next": "n12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Or maybe you're pushing too hard and everyone's too tense to play properly.",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "text": "Maybe we could take a short break? Everyone's been working really hard and--",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hanami winces mid-sentence, her hand drifting to her side. She covers it quickly with a smile.",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "--and I think fresh ears would help us hear where we need to improve.",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "We don't have time for breaks. The festival committee isn't going to give us extra minutes because we needed to rest.",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "nervous_smile",
      "text": "I-I can keep going! I'll get it right, I promise!",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Laura's hands are trembling over her sheet music. She's trying so hard it's making everything worse.",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "See? You're scaring her. That's not how you get good music out of people.",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "And your way is what, exactly? Slouch around and hope it works out?",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tension in the room is suffocating. Everyone's looking at you.",
      "next": "n23"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Side with Tiffany's strict approach",
          "target": "n24_tiffany"
        },
        {
          "text": "Side with Cassian's relaxed approach",
          "target": "n24_cassian"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n24_tiffany",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Tiffany's right. We only get one shot at this. Let's push through.",
      "next": "n25_tiffany_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25_tiffany_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n26_tiffany_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_tiffany_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Thank you. At least someone understands what's at stake.",
      "next": "n27_tiffany_cassian"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_tiffany_cassian",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Fine. Don't come crying to me when everyone burns out.",
      "next": "n30_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24_cassian",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Cassian has a point. We're not going to sound good if everyone's stressed out.",
      "next": "n25_cassian_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25_cassian_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "cassian_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n26_cassian_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_cassian_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_rot",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n27_cassian_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_cassian_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "See? Even the new kid gets it.",
      "next": "n28_tiffany_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_tiffany_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "...Fine. Five minutes. Then we're running it again.",
      "next": "n29_narration"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29_narration",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany turns away, but you catch something in her expression. Not anger. Something closer to hurt.",
      "next": "n30_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_converge",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "After a tense silence, everyone takes their positions again.",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "From the bridge. On my count.",
      "next": "n32"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/countdown_beep.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "next": "n33"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33",
      "type": "game",
      "song": "pressure_rehearsal_generated",
      "next": "n34"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The last note fades. Nobody speaks.",
      "next": "n35"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Better. But the second verse still drags. And the finale needs more energy.",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    {
      "id": "n36",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "annoyed",
      "text": "Of course. Nothing's ever good enough.",
      "next": "n37"
    },
    {
      "id": "n37",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "It will be. It has to be.",
      "next": "n38"
    },
    {
      "id": "n38",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There's a weight behind her words that goes beyond the festival. Like she's talking about something else entirely.",
      "next": "n39"
    },
    {
      "id": "n39",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Practice ends in silence. Everyone packs up without a word, avoiding each other's eyes.",
      "next": "n40"
    },
    {
      "id": "n40",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n41"
    },
    {
      "id": "n41",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n42"
    },
    {
      "id": "n42",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n43"
    },
    {
      "id": "n43",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n44"
    },
    {
      "id": "n44",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The club room feels emptier than it should. The instruments sit untouched, like they're holding their breath too.",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    {
      "id": "n45",
      "type": "end",
      "next_scene": "scenes/act2/scene2_generated.json"
    }
  ]
